summary:
  A start of the station the engine already holds retires an arm whose address write has not answered.

history:
  Measured on the bench with a segment writer killed under a listener 30 s
  behind: the buffer was heard out, the broadcast came back, and it played on
  with no buffer and a stray address file. The engine had armed the single
  file a moment before the widget's own start of the station asked it to note
  the live playback, and the note took an arm without a writer for a dead one.

target:
  package/contents/ui/TimeshiftEngine.qml

find:
          if (windowFull || (!writerUp && _pendingRun === "")) active = false;

replace:
          if (windowFull || !writerUp) active = false;

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_slideengine.qml::test_the_broadcast_after_a_frozen_buffer_has_a_buffer_behind_it
  and by tests/qml/tst_timeshiftengine.qml::test_a_second_start_before_the_address_is_down_keeps_the_arm.
